  "subject": "a man whose gas water heater dies mid-shower on the coldest night of the Taipei winter, who boils pot after pot of water to rinse the shampoo out, only for the repairman to find next morning that the gas tank was simply empty",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien Puerto Rican plena, traditional street style. Three hand-held panderetas interlocking, the requinto slapping improvised accents over the steady seguidor; a scraped güiro; a bright Puerto Rican cuatro guitar picking short melodic fills; an accordion answering each line; a plucked upright bass. Live, roomy, acoustic street-band sound with the frame drums upfront. A sharp, chatty male baritone lead telling the story, with a mixed group chorus answering every call. 110 BPM, D major. Shivering and indignant then laughing, danceable. No reggaeton dembow beat, no trap, no autotune, no synthesizers, no salsa horn section.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n寒流來矣 台北八度\n我褪衫 跳入浴間\n水道頭一開 燒一秒鐘\n紲落來 冰甲哀爸叫\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n熱水器 熱水器\n你哪會 揀今仔暗\n\n[Chorus]\n熱水器歹去矣 (歹去矣)\n規身軀 起雞母皮\n熱水器歹去矣 (歹去矣)\n洗頭毛 猶規頭殼泡\n\n[Verse]\n我披浴巾 走出去看\n瓦斯桶仔 敲兩下\n喀喀喀 火點袂著\n厝內的狗 嘛咧吠我\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n敲電話 予師傅\n伊講明仔載 才會到\n\n[Chorus]\n熱水器歹去矣 (歹去矣)\n喙齒咧 拍鼓仔\n熱水器歹去矣 (歹去矣)\n今暗 我欲按怎洗\n\n[Verse]\n我提電鍋 煮一鍋水\n一鍋一鍋 捧入浴間\n用面桶 慢慢仔沖\n煙一直衝 若咧炊粿\n\n[Bridge]\n師傅隔轉工 探頭入來\n講瓦斯 是無去爾爾\n換一桶 五分鐘\n\n[Chorus]\n熱水器好矣 (好矣)\n規間浴間 白霧霧\n熱水器好矣 (好矣)\n我洗甲 皮攏皺去\n\n[Outro]\n下擺 瓦斯先叫",
